## Live specimen capture

cmu-specimen-sedation-building = {CAPITALIZE(THE($target))} staggers as the sedative takes hold.
cmu-specimen-sedated = {CAPITALIZE(THE($target))} collapses, sedated!
cmu-specimen-woke = {CAPITALIZE(THE($target))} shakes off the sedative!
cmu-specimen-examine-sedated = [color=#9fd8b0]{CAPITALIZE(SUBJECT($target))} {CONJUGATE-BE($target)} sedated, for about {$seconds} more seconds.[/color]
cmu-specimen-contained = {CAPITALIZE(THE($target))} is sealed into the specimen crate.
cmu-specimen-crate-locked = The crate is locked. It needs Company access.
cmu-specimen-crate-examine-full = It holds {THE($target)}.
cmu-specimen-crate-examine-empty = It is empty.
cmu-specimen-crate-examine-open = The lid is open. Drag a downed specimen onto it and close the lid to seal it in.
cmu-specimen-crate-examine-closed = The lid is sealed.

cmu-specimen-actions-blocked = You're held too tightly to do that.
